{
  "name": "Google - Telemetry & Ads",
  "description": "Google Analytics, Firebase Analytics/Crashlytics, and the DoubleClick/AdSense ad stack. Excludes googleapis.com hosts that carry real functionality (Play Store updates, push messaging, Safe Browsing) - see README for that list before you go nuclear on *.googleapis.com.",
